    bob/checks/ssh.py (24 sites, -146 lines). Other notable:
    hardening.py (8), samba.py (6), mac_policy.py (6), clamav.py (5),
    disk.py (5), iptables_nftables.py (5), firewall.py (4),
    firewall_stack.py (4). All sshd_config directives, all sysctl
    policy branches, all systemd-service inactive branches converge
    on a single uniform call shape.
