    internally invokes the existing warn/alert + add_deduction
    sequence — wire output is bit-identical to v0.5.0.
  * Migration discipline: 6 waves (1-site files -> 2-site ->
    3-site -> 4-6 site -> hardening -> ssh.py), full pytest run
    between each wave.
